{"content":[{"c":["SIMEON (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Second of the 12 sons of Jacob (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.35.23","r":"Gen.35.23","rawR":"Gen.35.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.35.23","value":"Gen.35.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 35:23"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.1","r":"1Chr.2.1","rawR":"1Chr.2.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.1","value":"1Chr.2.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:1"},") and the second son borne to him by Leah (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.29.33","r":"Gen.29.33","rawR":"Gen.29.33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.29.33","value":"Gen.29.33"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 29:33"},"). Simeon fathered six sons (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.6.15","r":"Exod.6.15","rawR":"Exod.6.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.6.15","value":"Exod.6.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 6:15"},") and settled his family in Egypt with Jacob and his brothers (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.1.2","r":"Exod.1.2","rawR":"Exod.1.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.1.2","value":"Exod.1.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"1:2"},"). He was the founder of the Simeonites (",{"href":"?bref=Num.26.12-14","r":"Num.26.12-14","rawR":"Num.26.12-14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.26.12-14","value":"Num.26.12-14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 26:12-14"},") and one of the 12 tribes of Israel (",{"href":"?bref=Num.1.23","r":"Num.1.23","rawR":"Num.1.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.1.23","value":"Num.1.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"1:23"},"). He is remembered most for his vengeance on the men of Shechem because of Dinah’s rape (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.34.25","r":"Gen.34.25","rawR":"Gen.34.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.34.25","value":"Gen.34.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 34:25"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=SimeonTribeof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"SimeonTribeof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"SimeonTribeof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Simeon, Tribe of"},"."],"sourceClass":"list-text","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Pious Jew living in Jerusalem who was assured that he would not die before he saw the promised Messiah. Led by the Holy Spirit to the temple, Simeon met Mary and Joseph there, held Jesus in his arms, and prophesied about the Messiah’s coming mission (",{"href":"?bref=Luke.2.25-35","r":"Luke.2.25-35","rawR":"Luke.2.25-35","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.2.25-35","value":"Luke.2.25-35"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 2:25-35"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Ancestor of Jesus in Luke’s genealogy (",{"href":"?bref=Luke.3.30","r":"Luke.3.30","rawR":"Luke.3.30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.3.30","value":"Luke.3.30"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 3:30"},"). ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=GenealogyofJesusChrist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"GenealogyofJesusChrist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"GenealogyofJesusChrist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Genealogy of Jesus Christ"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. One of five prophets and teachers mentioned in ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.13.1","r":"Acts.13.1","rawR":"Acts.13.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.13.1","value":"Acts.13.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 13:1"}," who was serving in the church of Antioch. Simeon was surnamed Niger and was perhaps from Africa. Symeon is a better reading of the Greek in this text."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Reference to Simon Peter in ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.15.14","r":"Acts.15.14","rawR":"Acts.15.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.15.14","value":"Acts.15.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 15:14"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=PetertheApostle_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"PetertheApostle_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"PetertheApostle_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Peter, The Apostle"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"SimeonPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 35:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.35.23","rawQueryValue":"Gen.35.23","sourceRefExact":"Gen.35.23"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 2:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.2.1","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.2.1","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.2.1"},{"anchorText":"Gn 29:33","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.29.33","rawQueryValue":"Gen.29.33","sourceRefExact":"Gen.29.33"},{"anchorText":"Ex 6:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.6.15","rawQueryValue":"Exod.6.15","sourceRefExact":"Exod.6.15"},{"anchorText":"1:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.1.2","rawQueryValue":"Exod.1.2","sourceRefExact":"Exod.1.2"},{"anchorText":"Nm 26:12-14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.26.12-14","rawQueryValue":"Num.26.12-14","sourceRefExact":"Num.26.12-14"},{"anchorText":"1:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.1.23","rawQueryValue":"Num.1.23","sourceRefExact":"Num.1.23"},{"anchorText":"Gn 34:25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.34.25","rawQueryValue":"Gen.34.25","sourceRefExact":"Gen.34.25"},{"anchorText":"Lk 2:25-35","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.2.25-35","rawQueryValue":"Luke.2.25-35","sourceRefExact":"Luke.2.25-35"},{"anchorText":"Lk 3:30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.3.30","rawQueryValue":"Luke.3.30","sourceRefExact":"Luke.3.30"},{"anchorText":"Acts 13:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.13.1","rawQueryValue":"Acts.13.1","sourceRefExact":"Acts.13.1"},{"anchorText":"Acts 15:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.15.14","rawQueryValue":"Acts.15.14","sourceRefExact":"Acts.15.14"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"93bee8639165469d4976d67105a76e36aaa4b72a115f9579e494173dc5a15708","sourceItemName":"SimeonPerson","sourceItemOrder":424,"sourceMember":"Articles/S.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"SimeonPerson","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Simeon (Person)","title":"Simeon (Person)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}